- Capability 

- Business Service 

- Workflow 

- Task 

- Decision 

- Policy 

- Rule 

- Risk 

- KPI 

- Business Value 

- Knowledge 

- Human Role 

- AI Agent 

- Organization 

- Customer 

- Asset 

- Event 

Bu nesneler BNOS'un resmi Enterprise Object Model'ini oluşturur.

